<section data-aud-show="b2b" class="section is-light"><div class="container"><div class="section_header is-tight"><h2 class="heading-h2">Where off-the-shelf tools stop</h2><p class="text-lead">Order-reading tools and standard connectors get a product, a price and a quantity across. Trade orders need everything around that - and that&#x27;s where they go wrong.</p></div><div class="card-grid"><div class="card pain-card"><h3 class="heading-h3">Contract prices</h3><p class="card_text">Each account has its own price list, discount band or quantity break. The shop shows list price, or the last one someone uploaded.</p><div class="pain-chip">Acct 10442: £14.60 / 100 · Shop: £18.90 / 100</div></div><div class="card pain-card"><h3 class="heading-h3">Their part codes</h3><p class="card_text">Customers order with their own codes, not yours. Someone translates every line by hand.</p><div class="pain-chip">HB-M8-30SS → 933-0830-A2</div></div><div class="card pain-card"><h3 class="heading-h3">Packs and units</h3><p class="card_text">You sell in boxes of 100, drums of 50 metres, pallets. The connector sees “each” and the price is out by a factor of 100.</p><div class="pain-chip">Qty 4 boxes ≠ qty 4 bolts</div></div><div class="card pain-card"><h3 class="heading-h3">Orders by email</h3><p class="card_text">Most trade orders still arrive as a PDF, a spreadsheet or a line in an email. Reading tools pull out the lines - then someone still checks them and keys them in.</p><div class="pain-chip">“Same as last week plus 2 more resin”</div></div><div class="card pain-card"><h3 class="heading-h3">Accounts on hold</h3><p class="card_text">Credit limits, stop flags and payment terms live in the ERP. The shop happily takes the order anyway.</p><div class="pain-chip">Acct 20871: on stop, £3,240 overdue</div></div><div class="card pain-card"><h3 class="heading-h3">Stock that isn&#x27;t</h3><p class="card_text">Allocated stock, back orders and branch stock sync once a night, if at all. Customers order what you can&#x27;t ship.</p><div class="pain-chip">Shop: 55 in stock / ERP: 0 free</div></div></div></div></section>